Synthetic local OpenTelemetry evidence

Collector: otel/opentelemetry-collector-contrib:0.126.0
Service: durable-agent-runtime-control-plane
Exporter: local collector debug exporter
Requests: GET /healthz, GET /metrics

Resource attributes:
  service.name: durable-agent-runtime-control-plane

Span: http.request
  http.request.method: GET
  url.path: /healthz
  http.response.status_code: 200

Span: http.request
  http.request.method: GET
  url.path: /metrics
  http.response.status_code: 200

The capture intentionally excludes request headers, tenant identifiers, API
keys, provider credentials, request bodies, prompts, and tool/model output.
